ion" "value" "The line integral of unity with respect to $y$ along a path $C$ is equal to the net change in $y$ between the terminal and initial points:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y={y}_{2}-{y}_{1},\n$$\n\nwhere ${y}_{2}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the terminal point, and ${y}_{1}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the initial point.\n\nIn our case, ${y}_{2}=0$ and ${y}_{1}=-1.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y={y}_{2}-{y}_{1}=0-(-1)=1.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14059897/state.json" "file_sha256" "b17ac954cae06bb27e717726d39daf0dfb673322cc32aedb2cdbf4cacbf000d8"} {"question" "q-124336" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14059897/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8bc6f9dbda7d7db45fc648bd526ec9f400f366d03fe9b9c0445eed2bf9de20ad"} {"question" "q-124336" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14059897/state.json" "file_sha256" "b17ac954cae06bb27e717726d39daf0dfb673322cc32aedb2cdbf4cacbf000d8"} {"question" "q-124336" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-1"] ["math" "-5"] ["math" "1"] ["math" "5"] ["math" "5+5\\sqrt{2}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14059897/state.json" "file_sha256" "b17ac954cae06bb27e717726d39daf0dfb673322cc32aedb2cdbf4cacbf000d8"} {"question" "q-124336" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "1"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14059897/state.json" "file_sha256" "b17ac954cae06bb27e717726d39daf0dfb673322cc32aedb2cdbf4cacbf000d8"} {"question" "q-124340" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14059897/assets/f2f82b83edb4a74641ca72729833f1a5a3ae339c113b0cefbb13b4bef8e8e9fa.png)\n\nCalculate ${\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y,$ where $C={C}_{1}\\cup {C}_{2}$ is the path comprising of a quarter circle of radius $2$ and a line segment, as shown above." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14059897/state.json" "file_sha256" "b17ac954cae06bb27e717726d39daf0dfb673322cc32aedb2cdbf4cacbf000d8"} {"question" "q-124340" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The line integral of unity with respect to $y$ along a path $C$ is equal to the net change in $y$ between the terminal and initial points:\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y={y}_{2}-{y}_{1},\n$$\n\nwhere ${y}_{2}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the terminal point, and ${y}_{1}$ is the $y$-coordinate of the initial point.\n\nIn our case, ${y}_{1}=2$ and ${y}_{2}=-1.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}y={y}_{2}-{y}_{1}=(-1)-2=-3.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14059897/state.json" "file_sha256" "b17ac954cae06bb27e717726d39daf0dfb673322cc32aedb2cdbf4cacbf000d8"} {"question" "q-124340" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14059897/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "8bc6f9dbda7d7db45fc648bd526ec9f400f366d03fe9b9c0445eed2bf9de20ad"} {"question" "q-124340" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "c